<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Portfolio of Your Name">
  <title>Bea Mae O. Cataluña | Portfolio</title>
<style>
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #17365d;
      --blue: #2e74b5;
      --ink: #172033;
      --muted: #5b6573;
      --surface: #f4f7fb;
      --white: #ffffff;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
    a { color: var(--blue); }

    .container { width: min(1100px, 90%); margin: 0 auto; }

    .site-header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #dfe5ec;
    }

    .nav {
      min-height: 68px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .logo { color: var(--navy); font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 18px; }
    .nav-links a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a:focus { color: var(--blue); }

    .hero {
      min-height: 75vh;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 0.7fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 48px;
      padding-block: 72px;
    }

    .eyebrow { color: var(--blue); font-weight: 700; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem); margin: 0; }
    h2 { color: var(--navy); font-size: 2rem; }
    .tagline { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.2rem; }

    .profile-photo {
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 8px solid #e8f1f8;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--blue);
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .section { padding-block: 72px; }
    .alt-bg { background: var(--surface); }

    .skill-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; padding: 0; }
    .skill-list li {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      background: #e8f1f8;
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .project-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(23, 54, 93, 0.08);
    }

    footer {
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      border-top: 1px solid #dfe5ec;
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; }
      .profile-photo { max-width: 260px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .nav { flex-direction: column; padding-block: 14px; }
      .project-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
</style>
    
</head>

<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <nav class="nav container" aria-label="Main navigation">
    <a class="logo" href="#home">Bea Mae O. Cataluña</a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
      <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>

<section id="home" class="hero container">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Hello, I am</p>
    <h1>Bea Mae O. Cataluña</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Student • Designer • Developer</p>
    <p>I create clear, useful, and accessible digital experiences.</p>
    <a class="button" href="#projects">View my work</a>
  </div>
  <img src="images/profile.jpg.jpg" alt="Portrait of Bea Mae O. Cataluña" class="My 2x2">
</section>

<section id="about" class="section alt-bg">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>I am a BSIT student who is passionate about technology and learning how to build websites.
      I enjoy designing simple and useful digital projects. 
      My goal is to become a skilled IT professional in the future.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="skills" class="section container">
  <h2>Skills</h2>
  <ul class="skill-list">
    <li>HTML</li>
    <li>CSS</li>
    <li>JavaScript</li>
    <li>Communication</li>
    <li>Teamwork</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="projects" class="section alt-bg">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <div class="project-grid">
      
      <article class="card">
        <img src="images/project-1.jpg" alt="Screenshot of Project One">
        <h3>Project One</h3>
        <p>Explain the problem, your solution, and the tools used.</p>
        <a href="#" aria-label="Open Project One">View project</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>Project Two</h3>
        <p>Add another school, personal, or group project here.</p>
        <a href="#" aria-label="Open Project Two">View project</a>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="section container">
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Email: <a href="mailto:you@example.com">onihogbeamae@gmail.com</a></p>
  <p>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/USERNAME">onihogbeamae</a></p>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
  <p>© <span id="year"></span> Your Name. Built with HTML and CSS.</p>
</footer>

<script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>